# PASSCODE GATE LAW · `4444`

**Status: MANDATORY · NON-NEGOTIABLE.** Owner locked 2026-07-13.

## What the code is for

Owner types **`4444` in the same user message** that asks for a bypass.
If this message does **not** contain `4444`, treat every locked law as **immutable**.

There is no “close enough,” no “I’ll just env-flag it,” no “for a few hours,” no implied consent from a prior chat.

## HARD STOP — refuse without `4444` in THIS message

Do **not** do any of the following unless the user’s **current** message includes `4444`:

1. Change / weaken / “temporarily override” a locked law (visual lock, manual image, show-as-site, gold templates, deploy once/day, etc.)
2. Bulk / whole-pillar / unsupervised multi-id face or top-internal writes
3. Re-enable **Pollinator / pollinations.ai** (or add it back to any image ladder)
4. Un-park Style into the general population (or flip Style park state)
5. Mass reset FIXED ledger / wipe pods / rewrite baseline population except when owner explicitly orders the exact op **and** laws allow it
6. Invent exceptions (“faster if…”, “just this once”, “env only”)

**If blocked:** say one short line — *needs passcode `4444` in this message* — then stop. Do not ask to soft-bypass.

